{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0652_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0652_1000_p", "source_sha256": "928802f84925979289dcc61486896decb6a5cfc7c90545e37a3e19b48b07c1b0", "ja": "（『アイドルスペースウォーズ』に出演する志保。\nかなり気合いが入っている様子だ……）", "zh": "（志保出演了《偶像太空大战》。\n看起来干劲十足……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0652_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0652_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "3d6a9fa0f3ac8230a09661afd6daba993921e7e23bdcec3567d94258635a8a4b", "ja": "「もういい。時間の無駄だ。一撃で終わらせてやる」\n……ううん、違うな。もっと冷たい雰囲気で……。", "zh": "“够了。简直浪费时间。一击就解决你”\n……不对，不是这样。要更有冰冷的气场才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0652_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0652_1002_p", "source_sha256": "553e3b28a11bca0ac91eb8ba106cc4efaf71e5c947756bdb1b09a17f0b2ad58e", "ja": "お疲れ様、志保！\nうん、かなりいい感じじゃないか？", "zh": "辛苦了，志保！\n嗯，感觉相当不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0652_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0652_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "f4ed1fec1048ce60800561409294647a95074aa402078a0de8edd8395371b101", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\nいえ、自分では、まだ納得できていないので。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n不，我自己还不太能接受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0652_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0652_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "f95258d43c61d0a492ee205278e93b16e8529a7de11dab40beabec37e6be0a1d", "ja": "役としての冷酷さ、迫力が出ないんです。\n何かが足りない気がして……。", "zh": "作为角色的冷酷感与魄力，总觉得演不出来。\n感觉还欠缺了些什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0652_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0652_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ccfb3b2451ee59271e9b71cd6c9966941f31b746de644ad5ab87e40ca22fa81f", "ja": "うーん、それだったら……もう少し、\nニョロニョロした感じがあるといいんじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯——既然这样的话……要是再多一点扭来扭去的感觉，应该会更好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0652_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0652_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "f4fc2444b313b4647462d8bede8fbbb16e82278628a23bb6bdf756c94c8c0756", "ja": "は？　ニョロニョロ感……？\nあの、何を言っているか、よくわからないんですけど。", "zh": "哈？　扭来扭去的感觉……？\n那个，我不太明白你在说什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0652_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0652_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d8bc1dda3f895d2eb0ce8d45227a9476da565a9ac87217804306e8171ba1ed6c", "ja": "おっ！　今の、その感じだ！\n冷酷な迫力、出てると思う！", "zh": "哦！就是刚才那种感觉！\n我觉得冷酷的气势已经出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0652_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0652_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "3d1f4a8e374ed484787fa7cc664bf4d19961da203107d987a4623b0073ac5da7", "ja": "はぁ。\nそれで、ニョロニョロって何ですか？", "zh": "哈啊。\n所以说，“扭来扭去”是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0652_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0652_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ff229a0321c1f18361c5eb95706121ce1b7c020c26830775322636952ae9e02c", "ja": "何って、エイリアンの触手だよ。\n宇宙生物って感じがして、迫力があるだろ？", "zh": "所谓扭来扭去的东西，就是外星人的触手啊。\n很有宇宙生物的感觉，很有气势吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0652_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0652_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "87b92b2fd59c9a7ea5bba0dc8335b9182d08221f3293f642e7fc9e7abcdd8d25", "ja": "……。なるほど、糸口は掴めた気がします。\nありがとうございました。……不本意ですけど。", "zh": "……。原来如此，我好像找到点头绪了。\n谢谢您。……虽然很不情愿就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
